      "value": "An icon got lost in this update, the Interaction status icon is gone now. It's an icon that shows whether or not a person has physbone and contact interaction enabled, it shows up as a yellow hand, or a white hand with a red line through it.\n\nMore than once have I diagnosed a problem with interactions because someone had them disabled and didn't know it, but one look at the nameplate told me.",
